# Highlights

- PSC-derived CMs undergo maturation when transplanted into neonatal rat hearts

- hiPSC-derived CMs mature to adult CMs when transplanted into rat neonatal hearts

- This in vivo maturation system allows iPSC-based modeling of cardiomyopathy

